eyes looking at me.

476
01:12:01.898 --> 01:12:06.199
Sometimes I think I know so much more
about the world than other people.

477
01:12:06.361 --> 01:12:12.619
You see, I took drugs once, and it kind of
opened up this window for me.

478
01:12:12.784 --> 01:12:14.707
I call it the Window of Truth.

479
01:12:14.869 --> 01:12:17.042
<i>Real life's so hard to find.</i>

480
01:12:17.205 --> 01:12:20.379
...I saw the world in a different way...

481
01:12:21.376 --> 01:12:22.923
<i>Where is it?</i>

482
01:12:23.962 --> 01:12:26.511
...I see things other people do not...

483
01:12:27.298 --> 01:12:29.596
I think you had that experience, too.

484
01:12:29.759 --> 01:12:31.306
<i>How do you get there?</i>

485
01:12:38.142 --> 01:12:41.817
<i>Get out of the big cloud of dust
everybody's kicking up.</i>

486
01:12:48.152 --> 01:12:50.246
<i>The only way out is in.</i>

487
01:12:59.163 --> 01:13:00.710
<i>Breathe.</i>

488
01:13:06.129 --> 01:13:08.097
<i>Your mind's a theater.</i>

489
01:13:14.137 --> 01:13:15.684
<i>I say, try it all.</i>

490
01:13:22.896 --> 01:13:24.443
<i>Why not?</i>

491
01:13:31.779 --> 01:13:33.873
<i>Then I fell back asleep.</i>

492
01:13:35.116 --> 01:13:36.663
<i>Sing for me.</i>

493
01:13:39.329 --> 01:13:40.876
<i>Dream another dream.</i>

494
01:14:02.393 --> 01:14:05.522
<i>...who laid the foundations of the earth,</i>

495
01:14:05.688 --> 01:14:08.237
<i>that it should not be removed for ever.</i>

496
01:14:08.399 --> 01:14:13.371
<i>The waters stood above the mountains.
At thy rebuke they fled,</i>

497
01:14:13.529 --> 01:14:16.248
<i>at the voice of thy thunder
they hasted away.</i>

498
01:14:16.407 --> 01:14:21.288
<i>They go down by the valleys unto the place
which thou hast founded for them.</i>

499
01:14:22.455 --> 01:14:25.254
<i>He causeth the grass to grow for the cattle</i>

500
01:14:26.751 --> 01:14:32.804
<i>and herb for the service of man that he may
bring forth food out of the earth...</i>

501
01:14:46.354 --> 01:14:50.734
Very loving and enchanting.
Most affectionate.

502
01:14:51.401 --> 01:14:52.948
Real nice to get along.

503
01:14:53.111 --> 01:14:54.909
Very beautiful.

504
01:14:55.071 --> 01:15:00.999
I like your outfit, too, especially the
boots. Now they're a touch of class.

505
01:15:01.160 --> 01:15:03.504
Are you a religious man?

506
01:15:03.663 --> 01:15:07.418
- You have a cross around your neck.
- Absolutely.

507
01:15:07.583 --> 01:15:12.180
Oh, even though I'm in darkness,
I believe in the light.

508
01:15:14.841 --> 01:15:17.469
I was instructed from some information

509
01:15:17.635 --> 01:15:20.730
to be no part of the world
nor of the things in it.

510
01:15:20.888 --> 01:15:25.359
But my eyes are now simple,
and I'm carnal when I see beautiful women

511
01:15:25.518 --> 01:15:29.193
and big cars and lots of money,
and I wanna be a part of it.

512
01:15:34.402 --> 01:15:37.997
I mean, who needs a bed
this big? Pretty good, huh?

513
01:15:38.156 --> 01:15:39.703
Look at you,

514
01:15:39.866 --> 01:15:44.588
hanging out there with your girls and your
money. Are you feeling happy?

515
01:15:44.746 --> 01:15:46.498
- Yes.
- It makes you happy'?

516
01:15:46.664 --> 01:15:51.545
- It depends who owns the money.
- It's my new fur. He bought it for me.

517
01:15:52.962 --> 01:15:54.760
This man is in love with me.

518
01:15:54.922 --> 01:15:56.640
Just some other girl.

519
01:15:56.799 --> 01:15:58.346
- Hi, how are you?
- Hi.

520
01:16:13.191 --> 01:16:15.660
<i>And the world held up a mirror.</i>

521
01:16:17.653 --> 01:16:19.200
<i>Here.</i>

522
01:16:20.656 --> 01:16:22.329
<i>Take the things you want.</i>

523
01:16:28.664 --> 01:16:30.337
<i>They can be yours.</i>

524
01:16:45.848 --> 01:16:47.395
<i>Why do you hold back?</i>

525
01:16:54.065 --> 01:16:56.488
I thought you were dead.

526
01:16:56.651 --> 01:17:00.952
- I can't believe I actually met Elvis.
- You never know in this town.

527
01:17:01.072 --> 01:17:04.702
That's my move.
Do you think I'll be as famous as Elvis?

528
01:17:23.261 --> 01:17:25.013
<i>What a fool am I?</i>

529
01:17:25.179 --> 01:17:28.399
<i>Just to lie in a stinking dungeon.</i>

530
01:17:30.351 --> 01:17:32.570
<i>When I may as well walk at liberty.</i>

531
01:17:33.855 --> 01:17:37.826
<i>I have a key in my bosom called promise.</i>

532
01:17:40.069 --> 01:17:41.662
<i>And will I am persuaded,</i>

533
01:17:42.530 --> 01:17:45.374
<i>open any lock in Doubting Castle.</i>

534
01:17:47.201 --> 01:17:49.670
<i>Though in this dark and dismal state,</i>

535
01:17:50.788 --> 01:17:54.418
<i>he hath turned the shadow
of death into the morning,</i>

536
01:19:06.113 --> 01:19:07.660
<i>Go.</i>

537
01:19:14.538 --> 01:19:16.336
<i>Where?</i>

538
01:19:31.514 --> 01:19:33.141
<i>Find it.</i>

539
01:19:50.825 --> 01:19:52.372
<i>How do I reach you?</i>

540
01:20:00.084 --> 01:20:01.631
<i>Find my way there?</i>

541
01:20:45.838 --> 01:20:47.511
<i>Are you afraid?</i>

542
01:21:30.424 --> 01:21:32.722
<i>Sweetheart, my love,</i>

543
01:21:32.885 --> 01:21:36.640
<i>I don't feel guilty
that I've fallen in love with you.</i>

544
01:21:41.435 --> 01:21:42.982
<i>I'm glad.</i>

545
01:21:44.563 --> 01:21:46.611
<i>Grateful I still can.</i>

546
01:21:56.409 --> 01:21:59.959
<i>You're afraid
you're making me break my vows.</i>

547
01:22:04.834 --> 01:22:07.633
<i>But the vow comes out
of the love behind it.</i>

548
01:22:12.216 --> 01:22:14.685
<i>Love's so rare that when you find it</i>

549
01:22:16.637 --> 01:22:18.184
<i>you can't doubt it.</i>

550
01:22:20.933 --> 01:22:22.480
<i>Let it go.</i>

551
01:22:51.297 --> 01:22:55.473
<i>I remember when
I came down out of the mountains</i>

552
01:22:55.593 --> 01:22:59.268
<i>and I was conditioned with
being absolutely clear.</i>

553
01:22:59.430 --> 01:23:00.977
<i>Absolutely...</i>

554
01:23:02.183 --> 01:23:05.528
<i>if not enlightened,
at least wiser than I had been.</i>

555
01:23:06.562 --> 01:23:11.614
You have to kneel in a certain way and
you have to bow at the appropriate time.

556
01:23:11.775 --> 01:23:16.451
And it's all beautifully timed,
even the sound of when they announce...

557
01:23:31.962 --> 01:23:36.058
We walked 250 miles over the mountains,

558
01:23:36.217 --> 01:23:38.561
into Tibet area.

559
01:23:39.303 --> 01:23:43.353
And every... couple days,

560
01:23:43.516 --> 01:23:45.063
every 20 miles or so,

561
01:23:45.893 --> 01:23:49.818
you knew you were
going back in history, in time...

562
01:23:53.400 --> 01:23:56.404
But don't forget
their life is so circumscribed.

563
01:23:56.570 --> 01:24:02.168
If you're living in a cave eating nettles,
it's not so difficult to keep life simple.

564
01:24:02.785 --> 01:24:08.508
You don't have honking horns and your wife
running in saying "You screwed up!"

565
01:24:08.666 --> 01:24:14.173
The distractions are very few, and that's
the great attraction of the monk's life.

566
01:24:15.714 --> 01:24:19.389
<i>Teaching now... I only teach one thing.</i>

567
01:24:21.345 --> 01:24:23.643
<i>I just teach this moment.</i>

568
01:24:25.558 --> 01:24:28.027
<i>Pay attention to this moment.</i>

569
01:24:30.729 --> 01:24:32.572
<i>And everything is there...</i>

570
01:24:35.234 --> 01:24:36.736
<i>perfect...</i>

571
01:24:39.238 --> 01:24:40.785
<i>and complete.</i>

572
01:24:43.867 --> 01:24:45.414
<i>Just as it is.</i>

573
01:25:13.355 --> 01:25:15.323
<i>You're so quiet.</i>

574
01:25:17.484 --> 01:25:19.703
<i>You keep everything to yourself.</i>

575
01:25:26.493 --> 01:25:28.040
<i>You have love in you.</i>

576
01:25:30.039 --> 01:25:31.586
<i>I know it.</i>

577
01:25:39.256 --> 01:25:40.803
<i>When I'm with you...</i>

578
01:25:42.134 --> 01:25:44.182
<i>I forget everything else.</i>

579
01:25:49.725 --> 01:25:51.693
<i>My husband...</i>

580
01:25:52.811 --> 01:25:54.358
<i>my life as I knew it.</i>

581
01:25:55.272 --> 01:26:01.575
Thumb, first finger, third
finger, left, fourth finger, third finger,

582
01:26:01.737 --> 01:26:08.837
<i>second finger, thumb, right hand, thumb,
first finger, second finger, thumb...</i>

583
01:26:11.121 --> 01:26:12.668
<i>Have I found you?</i>

584
01:26:25.969 --> 01:26:27.516
<i>Can it be?</i>

585
01:27:22.776 --> 01:27:24.323
<i>Answer me.</i>

586
01:27:35.164 --> 01:27:36.711
<i>So this is what we are.</i>

587
01:27:39.710 --> 01:27:41.257
<i>A fire.</i>

588
01:28:10.491 --> 01:28:12.038
<i>Come with me.</i>

589
01:28:22.044 --> 01:28:23.591
<i>Away.</i>

590
01:29:20.435 --> 01:29:21.982
Open your mouth.

591
01:29:44.293 --> 01:29:46.637
<i>I wanna go away with you.</i>

592
01:29:59.099 --> 01:30:00.646
<i>Marry you.</i>

593
01:30:46.063 --> 01:30:48.532
<i>Save what you can of your life.</i>

594
01:30:50.692 --> 01:30:52.239
<i>Look at me.</i>

595
01:30:56.365 --> 01:30:59.414
<i>Dan't lose it all
just because you've lost a part.</i>

596
01:31:56.383 --> 01:31:59.011
<i>I found out I was pregnant.</i>

597
01:32:04.057 --> 01:32:05.650
<i>Nate came back.</i>

598
01:32:13.650 --> 01:32:16.654
<i>And I wasn't sure if it was my husband's...</i>

599
01:32:21.658 --> 01:32:23.205
<i>or if it was yours.</i>

600
01:32:39.509 --> 01:32:42.183
<i>...to distract me right now</i>

601
01:32:42.345 --> 01:32:44.598
<i>but I wanted to tel! you, to...</i>

602
01:32:45.348 --> 01:32:48.443
acknowledge that it was...

603
01:32:52.355 --> 01:32:53.902
I wake up and...

604
01:32:55.817 --> 01:32:58.866
I forget about it
for a few minutes and then...

605
01:33:02.657 --> 01:33:04.534
and then I remember.

606
01:33:12.042 --> 01:33:17.139
She's like "I had four of them.
You have to get over it and stop crying."

607
01:33:48.954 --> 01:33:50.877
<i>What are we now?</i>

608
01:34:40.463 --> 01:34:42.010
<i>Forgive me.</i>

609
01:36:25.402 --> 01:36:29.452
<i>There's so much love inside us.</i>

610
01:36:34.744 --> 01:36:36.291
<i>That never gets out.</i>

611
01:37:01.813 --> 01:37:03.486
<i>Have mercy on me.</i>

612
01:37:06.401 --> 01:37:08.699
<i>According to your unfailing love,</i>

613
01:37:11.990 --> 01:37:14.209
<i>your great compassion,</i>

614
01:37:16.077 --> 01:37:18.830
<i>blot out my transgressions.</i>

615
01:37:42.562 --> 01:37:44.109
<i>My son.</i>

616
01:37:47.442 --> 01:37:48.989
<i>I know you.</i>

617
01:37:55.283 --> 01:37:57.206
<i>I know you have a soul.</i>

618
01:38:18.139 --> 01:38:20.483
<i>Seems you're alone.</i>

619
01:38:22.143 --> 01:38:23.690
<i>You're not.</i>

620
01:38:25.397 --> 01:38:29.652
<i>Even now,
He's taking your hand and guiding you</i>

621
01:38:29.818 --> 01:38:31.365
<i>by a way you cannot see.</i>

622
01:38:33.363 --> 01:38:37.664
If you are unhappy, you shouldn't
take it as a mark of God's disfavor.

623
01:38:39.327 --> 01:38:43.958
Just the contrary.
Might be the very sign He loves you.

624
01:38:44.124 --> 01:38:48.800
He shows His love
not by helping you avoid suffering,

625
01:38:48.962 --> 01:38:52.182
by sending you suffering,

626
01:38:54.968 --> 01:38:56.515
<i>by keeping you there.</i>

627
01:39:00.473 --> 01:39:04.068
To suffer binds you to something
higher than yourself,

628
01:39:04.227 --> 01:39:06.275
higher than your own will.

629
01:39:06.438 --> 01:39:08.281
Takes you from the world

630
01:39:09.107 --> 01:39:12.361
to find what lies beyond it.

631
01:39:16.698 --> 01:39:21.750
<i>We are not only to endure
patiently the troubles He sends,</i>

632
01:39:21.911 --> 01:39:23.913
<i>we are to regard them as gifts.</i>

633
01:39:28.042 --> 01:39:31.262
<i>As gifts more precious</i>

634
01:39:31.379 --> 01:39:34.223
<i>than the happiness we wish for ourselves.</i>

635
01:39:52.400 --> 01:39:54.323
<i>Just left you behind.</i>

636
01:39:58.948 --> 01:40:00.666
<i>To get burned up.</i>

637
01:41:12.146 --> 01:41:13.693
<i>How do I begin?</i>

638
01:42:05.241 --> 01:42:06.743
<i>Father.</i>

639
01:42:13.082 --> 01:42:14.629
<i>Give me courage.</i>

640
01:42:19.797 --> 01:42:21.344
<i>Strength.</i>

641
01:42:24.344 --> 01:42:26.096
<i>I'm proud of you.</i>

642
01:42:27.388 --> 01:42:28.935
<i>You've done well.</i>

643
01:42:32.810 --> 01:42:34.608
<i>Better than me.</i>

644
01:42:36.856 --> 01:42:39.234
<i>Which is the way it's supposed to be.</i>

645
01:44:32.263 --> 01:44:35.233
<i>Find the light
you know in the east.</i>

646
01:44:37.810 --> 01:44:39.483
<i>As a child.</i>

647
01:44:45.026 --> 01:44:46.573
<i>The moon.</i>

648
01:44:48.112 --> 01:44:49.659
<i>The stars.</i>

649
01:44:56.454 --> 01:44:58.377
<i>They serve you.</i>

650
01:45:01.375 --> 01:45:03.377
<i>They guide you on your way.</i>

651
01:45:10.718 --> 01:45:13.221
<i>The light in the eyes of others.</i>

652
01:45:20.019 --> 01:45:21.566
<i>The pearl.</i>

653
01:46:04.146 --> 01:46:05.693
Wake up.

654
01:46:26.043 --> 01:46:27.590
<i>Turn.</i>

655
01:46:37.346 --> 01:46:38.893
<i>Look.</i>

656
01:46:44.103 --> 01:46:45.650
<i>Come out.</i>

657
01:47:33.319 --> 01:47:34.866
<i>My son.</i>

658
01:47:44.497 --> 01:47:46.044
<i>Remember.</i>

659
01:50:35.751 --> 01:50:37.298
<i>Begin.</i>
